# Build context exclusions. Two jobs: keep the context small, and make it
# impossible for a secret to reach a layer.
#
# A file copied into any layer survives in the image history even if a later
# layer deletes it. `docker history` and an unpacked layer both give it back.
# That is why .env* is excluded here rather than cleaned up later.

.env
.env.*

# Rebuilt inside the image; copying the host's would bake macOS-native binaries
# into a Linux image and silently shadow `npm ci`.
node_modules
.next

.git
.gitignore
.github

# Not needed to build or run the app. Excluding them keeps the context small
# and keeps captured evidence (16 PNGs) out of the build entirely.
docs
tests
scripts
*.md
!README.md

.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
.claude-flow
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml
